{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/301416-cribbing-from-mummy","id":301416,"title":"Cribbing From Mummy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-03T12:39:53-08:00","id":301416,"title":"Cribbing From Mummy","content":"I was thinking (always a dangerous thing) and I was wondering...<br /> <br /> How athematic would the following ideas be?<br /> <br /> 1. Prometheans start off with Azoth 10 (Just like Mummies with Sekhem).<br /> 2. As you go through your Pilgrimage, your Azoth lowers as you achieve milestones.<br /> 3. Goal is to hit Azoth 0.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T12:55:38-08:00","id":301444,"title":"","content":"[insert long winded essay about how Mummy can' t answer Promethean's questions][/sarcasm]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T13:08:08-08:00","id":301456,"title":"","content":"Eh.<br /> The Humanity system(s) I + Verge came up with started at 3 or 4, and worked up; starting with high Azoth and winding down would be bad, however, because Promethean isn't about starting with that level of power. Mummies do it because they're veritable gods. Prometheans are quite the opposite.<br /> I wouldn't recommend it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S8EuNtxeJKwq4sKVVPe16_N0ylIashKpgfCCuA1UOM8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Promethean Homebrew.</a><br /> <br /> Yes, I made it the same way as a Promethean. No, the authorities haven't found me yet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","name":"Ben Quo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar685_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T13:10:45-08:00","id":301460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/301416-cribbing-from-mummy#post301416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was thinking (always a dangerous thing) and I was wondering...<br /> <br /> How athematic would the following ideas be?<br /> <br /> 1. Prometheans start off with Azoth 10 (Just like Mummies with Sekhem).<br /> 2. As you go through your Pilgrimage, your Azoth lowers as you achieve milestones.<br /> 3. Goal is to hit Azoth 0.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm not seeing what the virtue of this would be. Mummy is evoking very clear tropes in gothic mummy fiction and horror films where the villain is most powerful near the beginning of the movie, but eventually succumbs back to sleep and needs to work to stay active. This is not a trope with Frankenstein's Monster, The Island of Doctor Moreau, Golem myths, or other related stories.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T13:15:08-08:00","id":301464,"title":"","content":"Oops, forgot to mention that Azoth 10 would not mean <i>utter supernatural powerhouse</i> like it does with Mummy.<br /> <br /> You'd still start off with a small number of Transmutations, as it were - while the flame of Azoth is still blazing away inside you, there's no <i>refinement</i>.<br /> <br /> Part of your pilgrimage would be taking that raw potential and refining it with lessons about humanity.<br /> <br /> (Also, I failed in my ultimate mission! I didn't get Arc to give a MASSIVE spiel.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T13:43:52-08:00","id":301508,"title":"","content":"It's quite neat. It does loose the idea of trying to create a human soul by stoking your Azoth though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T14:39:33-08:00","id":301530,"title":"","content":"I don't like the resulting implication that the New Dawn is achieved BY extinguishing the Divine Flame, rather than it often being the impetus of transformation","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T14:41:41-08:00","id":301531,"title":"","content":"As far as cribbing stuff from other things goes, this one actually moderately works. I'd have it be a subsystem with a much larger time frame than Promtheans rather than killing the Azoth, but if you really wanted to up the dramatic angst(the good kind), the time limit could work well.<br /> <br /> Now I personally wouldn't use it and keep Prommies theoretically immortal or obscenely long lived due to going to the wastes and other such things, because part of me is a spiteful son of a bitch who relishes in the annoyance it would cause transhumanists(which the infantile part of me calls fair payback for coming in and raising a damn ruckus every time Promethean gets up to something new), but that's just me being a jerk.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I also wouldn't use it because it steps on Mummy's toes and robs it of its'v individuality, but if any line had to steal from Mummy in that way, it would be Promethean.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 11-03-2014, 05:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T17:14:54-08:00","id":301580,"title":"","content":"I'd crib from Memory more than Sekhem, but I'd work it backwards. You start off with your Integrity trait as Artifice - how inhuman/robotic you are - and your goal is to hit 0. Breaking points would be the recently mentioned 'Refinement shifts' or milestones. The gimmick is you don't know what your 'breaking points' are, which makes the goal of hitting 0 kinda difficult.<br /> <br /> But that's the point of the Pilgrimage","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T22:33:52-08:00","id":301836,"title":"","content":"Honest opinion? It works very well for Mummy because of the basic metaphor of old age, and of people getting weaker and weaker as they age. I don't see it working well for Promethean, I'm afraid.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-04T01:43:22-08:00","id":301941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/301416-cribbing-from-mummy?p=301580#post301580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd crib from Memory more than Sekhem, but I'd work it backwards. You start off with your Integrity trait as Artifice - how inhuman/robotic you are - and your goal is to hit 0. Breaking points would be the recently mentioned 'Refinement shifts' or milestones. The gimmick is you don't know what your 'breaking points' are, which makes the goal of hitting 0 kinda difficult.<br /> <br /> But that's the point of the Pilgrimage</div> </div> </div> </div>That actually makes alot of sense. Your Pilgrimage would then be a long journey of getting to know yourself and what you are/aren't capable of doing. I like this idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1958-krobeles","name":"Krobeles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-04T17:52:48-08:00","id":302790,"title":"","content":"You know I totally get where you are going with this - Azoth working against your humanity, lose power as you gain a greater sense of self.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2826-mikerand","name":"mikerand","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2826_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-04T18:12:44-08:00","id":302805,"title":"","content":"I was also thinking of it in terms of <i>converting</i> Azoth into a fully human soul.<br /> <br /> Not in a single act, but in a slow pilgrimage to the end.<br /> <br /> I hope you built up your humanity enough to not start off your new life with an Integrity of Low.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T16:09:55-08:00","id":303833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/301416-cribbing-from-mummy?p=302805#post302805\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was also thinking of it in terms of <i>converting</i> Azoth into a fully human soul.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or another way of looking at this could be that Azoth needs to be converted to Vitriol, which is then in turn the catalyst that makes the real human soul possible within one of the Created.<br /> <br /> ..I'm not endoursing this idea, but I think it may have merit. It certainly fits with themes found within <b>Promethean: the Created</b>, if not making any sense in terms of the mechanics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}